#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:4
msgid "Updater 的使用"
msgstr "Updater Usage"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:6
msgid "``Updater`` 系列的动画类是 JAnim 中一套强大的功能，包括："
msgstr "The ``Updater`` family of animation classes is a powerful feature in JAnim, including:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:8
msgid ":class:`~.DataUpdater` 以及 :class:`~.GroupUpdater`"
msgstr ":class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:10
msgid ":class:`~.StepUpdater` 以及 :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater`"
msgstr ":class:`~.StepUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:12
msgid ":class:`~.ItemUpdater`"
msgstr ":class:`~.ItemUpdater`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:14
msgid "我们将逐一介绍，并介绍若干重要的特性。"
msgstr "We will introduce them one by one, along with several important features."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:16
msgid "学懂 Updater 后，你就可以从基础教程“毕业”了！"
msgstr "Once you understand Updaters, you can graduate from the basic tutorials!"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:20
msgid ""
"JAnim 中的 ``Updater`` 系列动画类与 Manim 中的 ``updater`` 在概念上存在较大差异，若套用 Manim 中的概念可能导致理解偏差。"
msgstr ""
"The ``Updater`` series of animation classes in JAnim differs significantly in concept from ``updater`` in Manim. Applying "
"Manim concepts may lead to misunderstanding."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:23
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:25
msgid "使用内置的动画时，我们只能播放一种特定的的动画效果，而使用 Updater，我们可以使用代码更灵活地使控制物件每一帧的状态。"
msgstr ""
"When using built-in animations, we can only play a specific animation effect. With Updaters, we can use code to control "
"the state of items more flexibly on every frame."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:27
msgid "为了理解这些 Updater 之间的区别，我们现在需要将讨论的核心聚焦在 **动画是基于什么状态创建的** ："
msgstr ""
"To understand the differences between these Updaters, we first need to focus on **what state the animation is based on**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:29
msgid ":class:`~.DataUpdater` 和 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 基于 **“起始时刻的状态”**"
msgstr ":class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater` are based on **“the state at the starting moment”**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:31
msgid ":class:`~.StepUpdater` 和 :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` 基于 **“上一帧的状态”**"
msgstr ":class:`~.StepUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` are based on **“the state from the previous frame”**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:33
msgid ":class:`~.ItemUpdater` 很特殊，它不基于任何状态"
msgstr ":class:`~.ItemUpdater` is special in that it is not based on any state"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:35
msgid "你可能暂时对以上的描述感到陌生，我们接下来将会进一步地介绍它们，你不必担心。"
msgstr "The descriptions above may seem unfamiliar for now. We will introduce each of them in more detail, so don't worry."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:37
msgid ""
"不过你目前可以从以上的描述中看出，:class:`~.DataUpdater` 和 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 是一类的，而 :class:`~.StepUpdater` "
"和 :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` 是一类的。"
msgstr ""
"However, you can already see from the descriptions above that :class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater` belong "
"to the same category, while :class:`~.StepUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` belong to another."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:39
msgid "这样，你就可以从理解 5 种 Updater，简化到理解 3 种 Updater，这就是我们接下来的话题。"
msgstr ""
"This allows you to simplify the task from understanding 5 types of Updaters to understanding 3, which is what we will "
"discuss next."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:42
msgid "使用 DataUpdater 与 GroupUpdater"
msgstr "Using DataUpdater and GroupUpdater"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:44
msgid ""
"我们先从介绍 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 开始，它是最基础也是应用范围最广的一种 Updater，许多 JAnim 内置的动画都基于它实现。"
msgstr ""
"Let's start with :class:`~.DataUpdater`. It is the most basic and widely applicable type of Updater, and many built-in "
"JAnim animations are implemented using it."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:46
msgid "它的作用是基于起始时刻的状态，以时间为参数对物件进行修改："
msgstr "It modifies an item based on its state at the starting moment, using time as a parameter:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:13
msgid ""
"square = Square()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=3\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"square = Square()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=3\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:62
msgid ""
"我们在前面提到，Updater 最核心的功能就是“通过代码控制物件每一帧的状态”，这里的 ``data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` 就是我"
"们控制物件的代码，起到了让正方形顶点逆时针旋转的效果。"
msgstr ""
"As mentioned earlier, the core function of an Updater is to “control the state of an item on every frame using code”. "
"Here, ``data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` is the code we use to control the item, causing the vertices of the square to "
"rotate counterclockwise."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:64
msgid "我们需要了解 ``lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` 表示了什么含义，是如何让物件旋转起来的："
msgstr ""
"We need to understand what ``lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` means and how it makes the item rotate:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:66
msgid "其中的 ``data`` 和 ``p`` 分别表示 **“物件初始状态”** 以及 **“当前的时间信息”** ，这两个是 JAnim 提供的"
msgstr ""
"Here, ``data`` and ``p`` represent the **“initial state of the item”** and the **“current time information”**, "
"respectively. These two arguments are provided by JAnim."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:68
msgid ""
"冒号 ``:`` 后面就是我们需要完成的部分，这里我们使用 ``data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` 表示 “以初始状态为基础，旋转 "
"``p.alpha * PI`` 度”"
msgstr ""
"What comes after the colon ``:`` is the part we need to implement. Here, ``data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)`` means "
"“rotate by ``p.alpha * PI`` degrees based on the initial state”."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:72
msgid "这里的 ``p.alpha`` 表示的是动画进度，会随着动画的进行，从 0 逐渐增长到 1；常用的属性还包括："
msgstr ""
"Here, ``p.alpha`` represents the animation progress, gradually increasing from 0 to 1 as the animation proceeds. Other "
"commonly used attributes include:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:74
msgid "``p.global_t`` 表示当前的全局时刻"
msgstr "``p.global_t`` represents the current global time."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:76
msgid "``p.elapsed`` 表示到当前时可动画持续了多久，这是对 ``p.global_t - p.at`` 的简写"
msgstr ""
"``p.elapsed`` represents how long the animation has lasted up to the current moment. It is shorthand for ``p.global_t - "
"p.at``."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:78
msgid "我们完整地解读这个代码，即为："
msgstr "Putting the code together, we can interpret it as follows:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:84
msgid "正方形从初始状态 ``data`` 开始，根据动画的进度 ``p.alpha`` 旋转"
msgstr "The square rotates from its initial state ``data`` according to the animation progress ``p.alpha``."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:90
msgid "动画向前推进地越多，旋转量越大，这样就起到了逐渐旋转的效果。"
msgstr "The further the animation progresses, the greater the rotation, resulting in a gradual rotation effect."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:94
msgid "其实上面这个示例正是内置的 :class:`~.Rotate` 和 :class:`~.Rotating` 动画的实现方式"
msgstr ""
"In fact, the example above is exactly how the built-in :class:`~.Rotate` and :class:`~.Rotating` animations are "
"implemented."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:98
msgid ""
"在设计上，:class:`~.DataUpdater` 只是为了修改单个物件自身的状态而使用的， 哪怕你给他传入 ``root_only=False`` 参数，也只是"
"给所有后代物件逐个采用相同的效果，而不是将他们作为一个整体来操作。"
msgstr ""
"By design, :class:`~.DataUpdater` is intended to modify the state of a single item. Even if you pass ``root_only=False``, "
"it only applies the same effect to each descendant item individually, rather than treating them as a whole."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:101
msgid "而如果我们需要将一个物件组作为整体进行这样的动画，就需要用到 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 了："
msgstr "If we need to animate a group of items as a whole, we can use :class:`~.GroupUpdater`:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:13
msgid ""
"squares = Square() * 2  # 与 squares = Group(Square(), Square()) 基本等价\n"
"squares.points.arrange()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        squares,\n"
"        lambda group, p: group.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=3\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"squares = Square() * 2  # Roughly equivalent to squares = Group(Square(), Square())\n"
"squares.points.arrange()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        squares,\n"
"        lambda group, p: group.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=3\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:118
msgid ""
"可以发现，:class:`~.GroupUpdater` 的使用与 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 基本一致，区别只在于我们将 ``squares`` 作为一个整体进行"
"旋转。"
msgstr ""
"As you can see, :class:`~.GroupUpdater` is used in much the same way as :class:`~.DataUpdater`. The only difference is "
"that we rotate ``squares`` as a whole."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:122
msgid ""
"原则上来说，传入 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 以及 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 等 ``Updater`` 的函数不应产生“副作用”，也就是只能改"
"变 ``data`` 的状态，应避免产生对函数之外其它变量的影响。"
msgstr ""
"In principle, functions passed to ``Updater`` such as :class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater` should not "
"produce “side effects”, meaning they should only change the state of ``data`` and avoid affecting other variables outside "
"the function."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:126
msgid "最后我们附上一个 ``root_only=False`` 的 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 与 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 的对比。"
msgstr "Finally, here is a comparison between :class:`~.DataUpdater` with ``root_only=False`` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:134 ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:330
msgid "点击展开"
msgstr "Click to expand"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:140
msgid "前者是对各个后代物件独立应用旋转效果，后者是作为一个整体应用旋转效果。"
msgstr ""
"The former applies the rotation effect independently to each descendant item, while the latter applies it to the group as "
"a whole."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:13
msgid ""
"squares1 = Square() * 2\n"
"squares1.points.arrange()\n"
"\n"
"squares2 = squares1.copy()\n"
"\n"
"group = Group(\n"
"    Text('DataUpdater'), Text('GroupUpdater'),\n"
"    squares1, squares2\n"
").show()\n"
"group.points.arrange_in_grid(buff=LARGE_BUFF)\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        squares1,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI),\n"
"        root_only=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        squares2,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=4\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"squares1 = Square() * 2\n"
"squares1.points.arrange()\n"
"\n"
"squares2 = squares1.copy()\n"
"\n"
"group = Group(\n"
"    Text('DataUpdater'), Text('GroupUpdater'),\n"
"    squares1, squares2\n"
").show()\n"
"group.points.arrange_in_grid(buff=LARGE_BUFF)\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        squares1,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI),\n"
"        root_only=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        squares2,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.rotate(p.alpha * PI)\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=4\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:172
msgid "在能得到相同效果（如平移而非旋转）时， :class:`~.DataUpdater` 的性能会优于 :class:`~.GroupUpdater`。"
msgstr ""
"When the same effect can be achieved (such as translation rather than rotation), :class:`~.DataUpdater` will perform "
"better than :class:`~.GroupUpdater`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:181
msgid "有关 Updater 的一些实用操作"
msgstr "Some Useful Updater Operations"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:183
msgid ""
"我们刚介绍完 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 与 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` ，在介绍剩下的 Updater 之前，我们先了解一些有关 Updater 的"
"实用操作。"
msgstr ""
"We have just introduced :class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater`. Before introducing the remaining Updaters, "
"let's first learn some useful operations related to Updaters."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:188
msgid "``current()`` 的功能"
msgstr "The Function of ``current()``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:190
msgid ""
"对于传入 ``Updater`` 的函数而言，在动画过程中如果需要访问 **其它正在进行动画的物件** 的当前状态，可以在对应物件后面加上 "
"``.current()`` 来获取。"
msgstr ""
"For functions passed to ``Updater``, if you need to access the current state of **other items that are animating** during "
"the animation process, you can add ``.current()`` after the corresponding item to get it."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:194
msgid "如果不加 :meth:`~.Item.current`，只会得到 ``construct`` 函数中对应物件的最终状态，而非动画过程中的状态。"
msgstr ""
"If :meth:`~.Item.current` is not added, you will only get the final state of the corresponding item in the ``construct`` "
"function, not the state during the animation process."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:20
msgid ""
"dot1 = Dot(LEFT * 3)\n"
"dot2 = Dot()\n"
"\n"
"arrow = Arrow(dot1, dot2, color=YELLOW)\n"
"\n"
"self.show(dot1, dot2, arrow)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    dot2.update.points.rotate(TAU, about_point=RIGHT * 2),\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        arrow,\n"
"        lambda data, p:\n"
"            data.set_start_and_end(\n"
"                dot1.points.box.center,\n"
"                dot2.current().points.box.center\n"
"            )\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=4\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"dot1 = Dot(LEFT * 3)\n"
"dot2 = Dot()\n"
"\n"
"arrow = Arrow(dot1, dot2, color=YELLOW)\n"
"\n"
"self.show(dot1, dot2, arrow)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    dot2.update.points.rotate(TAU, about_point=RIGHT * 2),\n"
"    GroupUpdater(\n"
"        arrow,\n"
"        lambda data, p:\n"
"            data.set_start_and_end(\n"
"                dot1.points.box.center,\n"
"                dot2.current().points.box.center\n"
"            )\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=4\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:203
msgid "``dot2.update.points.rotate(TAU, about_point=RIGHT * 2)`` 相当于"
msgstr "``dot2.update.points.rotate(TAU, about_point=RIGHT * 2)`` is equivalent to"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:205
msgid ""
"GroupUpdater(\n"
"    dot2,\n"
"    lambda group, p: group.points.rotate(TAU * p.alpha, about_point=RIGHT * 2)\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"GroupUpdater(\n"
"    dot2,\n"
"    lambda group, p: group.points.rotate(TAU * p.alpha, about_point=RIGHT * 2)\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:212
msgid "这是一种简化写法，但并不是所有方法都可以这样简化，你可以具体试一试。"
msgstr "This is a simplified way of writing, but not all methods can be simplified this way. You can try it out yourself."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:214
msgid "在这个示例中，我们首先将 ``dot2`` 围绕一个圆周进行运动。"
msgstr "In this example, we first make ``dot2`` move around a circle."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:216
msgid ""
"然后在 ``arrow`` 的 ``Updater`` 函数中， 使用 ``.current()`` 便可以得到 ``dot2`` 当前运动到的位置，从而让箭头始终指向 "
"``dot2`` 。"
msgstr ""
"Then, in the ``Updater`` function of ``arrow``, using ``.current()`` allows us to get the current position of ``dot2``, "
"so that the arrow always points to ``dot2``."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:220
msgid "动画复合"
msgstr "Animation Combination"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:222
msgid ""
"JAnim 的各个 ``Updater`` 并非孤立，不仅可以使用 ``.current()`` 获知其它物件的当前动画状态，还可以在一个物件上 **叠加多个"
"** ``Updater``，依次应用动画效果。"
msgstr ""
"JAnim's various ``Updater`` are not isolated. Not only can you use ``.current()`` to know the current animation state of "
"other items, but you can also **stack multiple** ``Updater`` on one item, applying animation effects sequentially."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:224
msgid "在下面这个例子中，我们每两秒加入一个新的 ``Updater``，以演示“动画复合”的作用："
msgstr ""
"In the following example, we add a new ``Updater`` every two seconds to demonstrate the effect of “animation combination”:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:20
msgid ""
"square = Square()\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"\n"
"# 这里每次 play 都多一个 Updater，用于演示 动画复合 的效果\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"###############################\n"
"\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.shift(UP * math.sin(p.alpha * 4 * PI)),\n"
"        become_at_end=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"###############################\n"
"\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.shift(UP * math.sin(p.alpha * 4 * PI)),\n"
"        become_at_end=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    square.update(become_at_end=False).color.set(BLUE).r.points.rotate(-TAU),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"square = Square()\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"\n"
"# Here, a new Updater is accumulated for every `play`\n"
"# to show the effect of animation combination\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"###############################\n"
"\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.shift(UP * math.sin(p.alpha * 4 * PI)),\n"
"        become_at_end=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"###############################\n"
"\n"
"square.points.to_border(LEFT)\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    square.anim.points.to_border(RIGHT),\n"
"    DataUpdater(\n"
"        square,\n"
"        lambda data, p: data.points.shift(UP * math.sin(p.alpha * 4 * PI)),\n"
"        become_at_end=False\n"
"    ),\n"
"    square.update(become_at_end=False).color.set(BLUE).r.points.rotate(-TAU),\n"
"    duration=2\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:233
msgid "可以给 ``Updater`` 传入 ``become_at_end=False`` 使物件在动画后回到最初的状态。"
msgstr ""
"You can pass ``become_at_end=False`` to ``Updater`` to make the item return to its initial state after the animation."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:235
msgid "但是 ``.anim`` 没有这种参数，所以这里每次都有 ``square.points.to_border(LEFT)``。"
