#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:282
msgid "使用 StepUpdater 与 GroupStepUpdater"
msgstr "Using StepUpdater and GroupStepUpdater"

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:284
msgid ""
":class:`~.StepUpdater` 与 :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` 的关系就像是 :class:`~.DataUpdater` 与 :class:`~.GroupUpdater` 之间"
"的关系 —— 一个是对一个物件自身进行操作，另一个是将整个物件组作为一个整体来操作。"
msgstr ""
"The relationship between :class:`~.StepUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupStepUpdater` is similar to that "
"between :class:`~.DataUpdater` and :class:`~.GroupUpdater`: one operates on an individual item, while the other operates "
"on an entire group of items as a whole."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:287
msgid ""
"我们先介绍一下 :class:`~.StepUpdater` ，它的作用是按步更新物件，适合用于 **“需要基于上一刻的状态更新下一刻状态”** 的情景，"
"例如物理模拟或是微分方程数值演示等。"
msgstr ""
"Let's first introduce :class:`~.StepUpdater`. It updates an item step by step and is suitable for scenarios **“where the "
"next state needs to be updated based on the previous state”**, such as physics simulations or numerical demonstrations of "
"differential equations."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:291
msgid ""
"我们将 :class:`~.StepUpdater` 的每一次状态更新称之为“一步”，且在构造时使用 ``step`` 参数表示每秒钟包含多少次更新，并不与帧"
"率相关"
msgstr ""
"We call each state update performed by :class:`~.StepUpdater` a “step”. When constructing it, the ``step`` parameter "
"specifies how many updates are performed per second, independently of the frame rate."

#: ../../source/tutorials/updaters.rst:293
msgid "以下是一个最简单（但也是最没必要使用 :class:`~.StepUpdater` ）的一个示例："
msgstr "The following is the simplest example (but also the least necessary use of :class:`~.StepUpdater`):"

